{"status": "progress", "message": "Retrieved 88 candidate paragraphs; kept 2", "stage": "retrieve", "claim_index": 0, "data": {"kind": "retrieval", "pass": 1, "queries": ["James Webb Space Telescope"], "candidates": 88, "by_source": {"arxiv": 3, "wikipedia": 82, "web": 3}, "avgdl": 115.1, "top": [{"text": "Aug 22, 2024 \u00b7 On December 25, 2021, and 7:20 AM ET (12:20 UTC), the James Webb Space Telescope was launched by an ArianeSpace Ariane 5 rocket from Europe's Spa", "source": "web", "dense": 0.809, "bm25": 16.01, "dense_rank": 1, "bm25_rank": 1, "rrf": 0.03279, "selected": true}, {"text": "James Webb Space Telescope Deployment Sequence (Nominal), 12 November 2021, pp. 1:47, archived from the original on 23 December 2021, retrieved 23 December 2021", "source": "web", "dense": 0.794, "bm25": 11.48, "dense_rank": 2, "bm25_rank": 4, "rrf": 0.03175, "selected": true}, {"text": "Webb died from a heart attack at Georgetown University Hospital in Washington on March 27, 1992, at age 85. He was buried in Arlington National Cemetery. NASA's", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.69, "bm25": 15.9, "dense_rank": 4, "bm25_rank": 2, "rrf": 0.03175, "selected": true}, {"text": "\"NASA's Webb Telescope Launches to See First Galaxies, Distant Worlds \u2013 NASA's James Webb Space Telescope launched at 7:20 a.m. EST Saturday [Dec. 25, 2021] on ", "source": "web", "dense": 0.777, "bm25": 8.56, "dense_rank": 3, "bm25_rank": 7, "rrf": 0.0308, "selected": false}, {"text": "Despite Webb's mirror diameter being 2.7 times larger than that of the Hubble Space Telescope, it produces images of comparable resolution because it observes i", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.649, "bm25": 10.87, "dense_rank": 7, "bm25_rank": 5, "rrf": 0.03031, "selected": false}, {"text": "He also dealt with the Apollo 1 fire. He helped found the National Academy of Public Administration, a key locus for governmental reform studies. In 2002, the N", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.559, "bm25": 9.03, "dense_rank": 12, "bm25_rank": 6, "rrf": 0.02904, "selected": false}, {"text": "Launched on December 25, 2021, it is considered the successor to the Hubble Space Telescope. This controversy was reported in the press. The scientists who prop", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.537, "bm25": 11.81, "dense_rank": 16, "bm25_rank": 3, "rrf": 0.02903, "selected": false}, {"text": "In 1997, NASA worked with the Goddard Space Flight Center, Ball Aerospace & Technologies, and TRW to conduct technical requirement and cost studies of the three", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.587, "bm25": 8.51, "dense_rank": 10, "bm25_rank": 8, "rrf": 0.02899, "selected": false}], "selected": 3, "echo_filtered": 1, "kept": 2}, "t": 6.207}
